// ************** MOS-MUSIC OpenHymnal ABC → JPW-ABC 1.0 **************\n// source = sources/openhymnal/OpenHymnal2014.06.abc\n// match = exact title match from content/production/tune-matching.json\n\n.Title\nTitle = 圣徒相通（Blest Be the Tie That Binds）\nKeyAndMeters = {1=C,3/4}\nWordsByAndMusicBy = Words: John Fawcett, 1782.\nMusic and Setting: 'Boylston' Lowell Mason, 1832.\ncopyright: public domain.  This score is a part of the Open Hymnal Project, 2012 Revision.\nExpression = {♩=90}\n\n.Voice\n5 | 3_ 4_ 5 6 | 5- 1' | 1'_ 7_ 6 6 | 5- 5 | 3_ 4_ 5 5 | 6_ 7_ 1' 7 | 1'_ 6_ 5 5 | 5- |\n\n.Words\nW1@1,1:\n{Blest} {be} {the} {tie} {that} {binds} {Our} {hearts} {in} {Christ} {ian} {love;} {The} {fel} {low} {ship} {of} {kin} {dred} {minds} {Is} {like} {to} {that} a {bove.}\n